iption":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-11-17T09:12:11Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T02:47:39Z","closed_at":"2025-11-17T22:49:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Godot 4.6 dev 4\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 Godot 4.6 dev 4\n\n### Issue description\n\nUsing VSCodium, attempts to connect to the Godot editor DAP result in following errors.\n\n```\n--- Debugging process started ---\n--- GDScript language server started on port 6005 ---\n[DAP] Connection Taken\n  ERROR: Bug: Dictionary::operator[] used when there was no value for the given key, please report.\n[DAP] Disconnected\n```\n\nExtension handling debug configs:\n\nDotRush  /  C#  (muhammad-sammy) :\n```\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Attach\",\n            \"type\": \"coreclr\",\n            \"request\": \"attach\",\n            \"debugServer\": 6006\n        }\n```\n\nMono Debug:\n```\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Attach with Mono\",\n            \"type\": \"mono\",\n            \"request\": \"attach\",\n            \"address\": \"localhost\",\n            \"debugServer\": 6006,\n        }\n```\n\nWhen the instance is running, the debugger connects, but it still shows error, and no breakpoints are hit.\n\n```\n[DAP] Connection Taken\n  ERROR: Bug: Dictionary::operator[] used when there was no value for the given key, please report.\n```\n\n\n\nExpected result:\n\nDebugger connects and waits for Godot to launch the game instance.\nWhen instance is ran, the breakpoints are hit.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUsing above configs in launch.json attempt to connect to Godot.exe without game instance running.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nUsing above configs in launch.json attempt to connect to Godot.exe without game instance running.","closed_by":{"login":"codingus-g","id":50211143,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMjExMTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50211143?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingus-g","html_url":"https://github.com/codingus-g","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingus-g/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingus-g/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingus-g/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingus-g/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingus-g/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingus-g/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingus-g/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingus-g/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codingus-g/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112879/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112879/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}